# Production Deployment

The recommended production architecture is:

```text
Internet
   │
   ▼
Nginx
   │
   ▼
Gunicorn
   │
   ▼
Flask Application
   │
   ▼
PostgreSQL
```

Recommended production environment:

* Ubuntu Server
* PostgreSQL
* Gunicorn
* Nginx
* HTTPS
* systemd

Example Gunicorn command:

```bash
gunicorn \
    --workers 3 \
    --bind 127.0.0.1:8000 \
    app:app
```

